      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Contemporary filmmakers continue drawing from Parajanov's visual vocabulary. **Uncle Boonmee Who Can Recall His Past Lives** (2010) by Apichatpong Weerasethakul shares its meditative pacing and symbolic imagery. **The Green Knight** (2021) borrows from its tableau approach to medieval imagery. Even music video directors like Tarsem Singh and Mark Romanek have cited The Color of Pomegranates as a crucial influence on their visual style."
